 "_doc": "Prince Albert LM (WC052) Afrikaans 'Collab' statement (same print stream as Umsobomvu/Cape Agulhas): header row REKENINGNOMMER / VOORSTAD-WAARDASIE-ERF-DEPOSITO-REKENINGDATUM / STRAAT ADRES, then a ledger 'Datum Verwysing Beskrywing BTW Bedrag' where every charge line prints its VAT and its VAT-INCLUSIVE amount. Electricity = 'E<ref> Elektrisiteit <new>-<old>=<kWh>' (single-rate, energy -> standard band) plus 'Elektrisiteit Basies' (other_r, printed from Nov-2025 on); ex-VAT = Bedrag - BTW per line. The Jul/Aug/Sep-2025 bills instead carry 'nn x Basiese heffing - Besigheid (Kon...' which is NOT labelled electricity, so it is kept natively (sundry) and not counted. read_end = the meter line's date; no start date printed. Fingerprint: municipal BTW number + masthead name. IDENTITY: pa_elec_ex_by_vat_r = electricity BTW x (1/0.15) (constant made with label_present) vs total_ex_vat_r: within R0.05 on 10/10 (per-line VAT rounding); side check: sum of all BTW cells = printed '-- BTW INGESLUIT --' on 10/10. Checked on 10 bills.",
